> Inspect the native model architecture

Two posterior observations and the intervening transition through the source LSTM64/Gaussian16 RSSM. Transition and imagination loops remain in the full program. This trace uses an independent store and does not change fitting.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/dreamer_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
